{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1KI",
 "chapter": 1,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.1",
   "range": "1KI.1.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "15e8a3fe",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.1#p1-c98e61e4",
     "text": "He was about 70 years old, 2Sa 5:4.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "old and stricken in years",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 5:4",
       "ref": "2SA.5.4"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.1#p2-84f4a81d",
     "text": "For his natural heat was worn away with travels.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "heat"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.3",
   "range": "1KI.1.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fe07b79f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.3#p1-fe07b79f",
     "text": "A city in the tribe of Issachar, Jos 19:18.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "a Shunammite",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jos 19:18",
       "ref": "JOS.19.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.5",
   "range": "1KI.1.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "57ce9469",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.5#p1-57ce9469",
     "text": "Read 2Sa 15:1.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "fifty men to run before him",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 15:1",
       "ref": "2SA.15.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.7",
   "range": "1KI.1.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bc197941",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.7#p1-bc197941",
     "text": "They took his part and followed him.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "helped him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.10",
   "range": "1KI.1.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fcf5b28d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.10#p1-fcf5b28d",
     "text": "As the Cherethites and Pelethites.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "the mighty men"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.12",
   "range": "1KI.1.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f286aa44",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.12#p1-f286aa44",
     "text": "For Adonijah will destroy you and your son, if he reigns.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "life"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.14",
   "range": "1KI.1.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "dd3cb3f7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.14#p1-dd3cb3f7",
     "text": "By declaring such things, as may further the same.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "confirm thy words"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.18",
   "range": "1KI.1.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a8a1ceae",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.18#p1-a8a1ceae",
     "text": "The king being worn with age, could not attend to the affairs of the realm, and also Adonijah had many who kept it from the king.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "it not"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.21",
   "range": "1KI.1.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2e2c0d47",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.21#p1-2e2c0d47",
     "text": "And so put to death as wicked transgressors.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "counted offenders"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.23",
   "range": "1KI.1.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6d5f78fd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.23#p1-6d5f78fd",
     "text": "Acknowledging him to be the true and worthy king appointed by God, as the figure of his Christ.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "to the ground"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.27",
   "range": "1KI.1.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fc25d0a4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.27#p1-fc25d0a4",
     "text": "Meaning, that in such affairs he should undertake nothing unless he had consulted with the Lord.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "servant"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.30",
   "range": "1KI.1.30",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "36c477db",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.30#p1-36c477db",
     "text": "Moved by the Spirit of God to do so, because he foresaw that Solomon would be the figure of Christ.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "sware unto thee by the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.33",
   "range": "1KI.1.33",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "22507a42",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.33#p1-22507a42",
     "text": "Meaning, the king's servants and such as were of his guard.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "servants of your lord"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.39",
   "range": "1KI.1.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fdfc071f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.39#p1-fdfc071f",
     "text": "With which they were accustomed to anoint the priests and the holy instruments, Ex 30:23.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "oil out of the tabernacle",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 30:23",
       "ref": "EXO.30.23"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.42",
   "range": "1KI.1.42",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9382d361",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.42#p1-9382d361",
     "text": "He praised Jonathan, thinking to have heard good news but God wrought things contrary to his expectation, and so beat down his pride.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "good tidings"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.47",
   "range": "1KI.1.47",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a46f43b7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.47#p1-a46f43b7",
     "text": "He gave God thanks for the good success.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "bed"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1KI.1.50",
   "range": "1KI.1.50",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "11ffdcd1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1KI.1.50#p1-11ffdcd1",
     "text": "Which David his father had built in the floor of Araunah, 2Sa 24:25.",
     "label": "t",
     "anchor": "altar",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 24:25",
       "ref": "2SA.24.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
